# Kind33SwingStop ($83:BA76), the JMP to Kind33Swing's stop that no
# branch, jump, word or resume address in the ROM leads to. Kind $33 is
# made as cov_kind33_swing.box makes it (the first level's record $092B
# with $07 0); 30 frames on, its swinging child (record $0BFB) has its
# resume address ($03-$04) set to $BA76: the loop's RTI starts it there,
# it stops (speed, phase, past and angle 0) and swings on.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
poke 000931 33
poke 000932 00
poke 000964 01
poke 0015E9 01
poke 000937 80,00
poke 00093A 20,01
poke 00092B 0C
wait 30
poke 000BFE 76,BA
wait 30
dump z
